# Git author/committer mapping.
#
# One person and their agent automation committed under several identities. This file
# collapses them to two canonical names so that `git shortlog -sne` and any provenance
# audit report the truth: the project has exactly one copyright holder and one agent.
# It rewrites nothing and changes no history; it only affects how Git displays authors.
#
# See docs/LEGAL-REVIEW.md §3.

